# Raw per-shard evaluation output, datasets and trained checkpoints are large
# (~280 MB) and fully reproducible: every job is recorded in docs/JOB_LEDGER.md,
# and the evaluation was verified bit-reproducible three times (768/768, 896/896
# and 896/896 rows re-executed identically). Only the artifacts the write-ups
# cite are tracked.
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/**/aggregate/**
!outputs/**/diagnostic/**
!outputs/**/training_summary.json
__pycache__/
